    "site_desc": "This site is located in Californnia's San Joaquin Valley on degraded pasture which is being restored to wetland habitats in 2023. The 78-acre parcel was previously graded to facilitate irrigation and cultivation, but has been fallow and used for cattle grazing since the 1990s. Surface hydrology of the parcel was also modified by the addition of summer irrigation. Historically the site likely supported wetlands, grasllands, and possibly a prtion of a tributary of the San Joaquin River.",
